meta {
  name: Get Finance Overview (College Admin)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/college-admin/payments/finance/overview
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{staffAccessToken}}
}

params:query {
  ~from_date: 2026-04-01
  ~to_date: 2026-08-22
}

docs {
  Finance dashboard summary for this college. Requires staff_member auth +
  finance.view.

  Query (both optional, YYYY-MM-DD IST days, filters on Transaction.createdAt) —
  the college-admin dashboard calls this WITHOUT any date filter (all-time
  "Overall Performance" totals), independent of whatever date range the
  Transactions History table below it has selected. Pass from_date/to_date
  only if you want a range-scoped summary instead:
  - from_date, to_date

  Response:
  {
    totalRevenue: string,                // sum of all completed transactions in range
    categories: {
      tuitionFees: string,               // fee_category in (tuition_fee, semester_fees, "tution fee")
      commuteBooking: string,            // fee_category = commute_fee
      studentHousingBooking: string,     // fee_category in (hostel_booking_fee, hostel_fee)
      applicationFees: string,           // fee_category = application_fee
      tokenFees: string,                 // fee_category = token_fee
      otherFees: string,                 // totalRevenue minus the five above: remaining fee-structure
                                         // categories (admission, exam, library, lab, etc.), legacy
                                         // values, and transactions with no ledger entry
    },

  The six categories always sum to totalRevenue.
    paymentMethodBreakdown: [
      { method: string, label: string, amount: string, percentage: number }
    ],                                   // percentages use largest-remainder rounding and
                                         // always sum to exactly 100
    overdueBalance: string,              // billed course fees (fee_structure_id set), unpaid,
                                         // due_date before today in IST — a fee is not overdue
                                         // on its own due date
    collectionVsTargetPercent: number,   // SUM(paid_amount) / SUM(net_amount) over billed course
                                         // fees only. Pay-to-proceed fees (application, token,
                                         // hostel, commute) are excluded: their ledger rows exist
                                         // only once checkout starts, so they would read ~100%
                                         // and unfinished attempts would add fees nobody owes
  }

  Important caveats (real limitations of current data, not bugs):
  - paymentMethodBreakdown only ever contains "mock" (all online/Razorpay
    payments — no real sub-method capture exists yet), "demand_draft", and
    "bank_transfer" (offline token payments). There is no UPI/Cards/Net
    Banking breakdown until a real Razorpay webhook is built.
  - overdueBalance only ever reflects instalment-based course fees — the only
    ledger rows that get a dueDate.
  - category amounts only ever reflect the online/mock provider + offline
    token flows that exist today — no admin dashboard-only fields.
}
